OL,3,GNEWSAChef celebrates inclusion in top
OL,4,Afood critic's book
OL,5,
OL,6,FA chef who opened a dumpling restaurant
OL,7,Fafter struggling to find work during
OL,8,Fthe coronavirus pandemic says it is
OL,9,F"pretty cool" to be featured in
OL,10,Faward-winning food critic Jay Rayner's
OL,11,Flatest book.
OL,13,FLittle Dumpling King in Hanley,
OL,14,FStoke-on-Trent, had already been
OL,15,Fmentioned in a Guardian write-up by
OL,16,FRayner two years ago, but Rob McIntyre
OL,17,Fsaid inclusion in Nights Out In The
OL,18,FKitchen "makes a massive difference".
OL,20,FRayner wrote that he enjoyed the
OL,21,Frestaurant's atmosphere and its
OL,22,F"loose-limbed goofy approach to life".
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
